tras/128d01ea2ebb73238abfe4d0c75172c5.avif?t=1787042378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162450/extras_big/128d01ea2ebb73238abfe4d0c75172c5.avif?t=1787042378 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful boss monsters.<br>They may occasionally drop valuable items!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162450/extras/1487ae461fc49b5e744f6589530b0ada.avif?t=1787042378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162450/extras_big/1487ae461fc49b5e744f6589530b0ada.avif?t=1787042378 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the monster you saw in your dream in the final battle and claim victory.<br>It is time to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>※ This game supports only Korean and Japanese. Your language is not supported.</u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162450/extras/e4e6dde9f0dc056c1275cb097753553b.avif?t=1787042378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4162450/extras_big/e4e6dde9f0dc056c1275cb097753553b.avif?t=1787042378 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you awaken, the mysterious girl from your dream is standing before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious girl says many things you cannot fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“According to legend, there are four powerful monsters in the neighboring town that threaten the world!”<br>“Will you save this world?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you save the world by following the